      "source": [
        "## Data Cleaning and Transformation\n",
        "\n",
        "Based on the overview, we'll now clean and transform relevant columns. I'll make some assumptions about common column names in a car dataset. If your column names are different, please let me know, and I can adjust the code.\n",
        "\n",
        "### 1. Cleaning 'Price' Column\n",
        "\n",
        "We will remove any non-numeric characters (like currency symbols, spaces, or text like 'AZN') and convert the 'Price' column to a numeric type. We'll also handle missing values by filling them with the median, as price can be sensitive to outliers."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/",
          "height": 224
        },
        "id": "da2fc616",
        "outputId": "f837b121-7837-4cbe-b45f-74813a2c91ad"
      },
      "source": [
        "if 'price_x' in df.columns:\n",
        "    # Remove non-numeric characters and convert to numeric\n",
        "    df['price_x'] = df['price_x'].astype(str).str.replace('[^0-9]', '', regex=True)\n",
        "    df['price_x'] = pd.to_numeric(df['price_x'], errors='coerce')\n",
        "\n",
        "    # Fill missing prices with the median\n",
        "    median_price = df['price_x'].median()\n",
        "    df['price_x'] = df['price_x'].fillna(median_price)\n",
        "    print(f\"'price_x' column cleaned. Missing values filled with median: {median_price}.\")\n",
        "elif 'price_y' in df.columns:\n",
        "    df['price_y'] = df['price_y'].astype(str).str.replace('[^0-9]', '', regex=True)\n",
        "    df['price_y'] = pd.to_numeric(df['price_y'], errors='coerce')\n",
        "    median_price = df['price_y'].median()\n",
        "    df['price_y'] = df['price_y'].fillna(median_price)\n",
        "    print(f\"'price_y' column cleaned. Missing values filled with median: {median_price}.\")\n",
        "else:\n",
        "    print(\"Neither 'price_x' nor 'price_y' column found. Skipping price cleaning.\")\n",
        "\n",
        "display(df.filter(like='price', axis=1).head())"
      ],
