        "### 5. Cleaning Categorical Columns ('Fuel_Type', 'Transmission', etc.)\n",
        "\n",
        "We will standardize categorical columns by converting them to lowercase and stripping whitespace. Missing values will be filled with 'Unknown'."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/",
          "height": 328
        },
        "id": "4bd46073",
